## WebSocket Protocol

### Connecting

```javascript
const ws = new WebSocket('ws://localhost:{{DEPLOYMENT.port | default: 8000}}/ws');

ws.onopen = () => {
  console.log('Connected to voice agent');
};
```

### Audio Format

- **Input/Output**: PCM16
- **Sample Rate**: 24000 Hz
- **Channels**: Mono

### Sending Audio

```javascript
// Send audio data as binary
ws.send(audioBuffer);  // ArrayBuffer of PCM16 data
```

### Receiving Events

```javascript
ws.onmessage = (event) => {
  if (event.data instanceof Blob) {
    // Audio data - play it
    playAudio(event.data);
  } else {
    // JSON event
    const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
    switch (data.type) {
      case 'transcript':
        console.log(`${data.role}: ${data.text}`);
        break;
      case 'tool_call':
        console.log(`Tool: ${data.name}`);
        break;
      case 'error':
        console.error(data.message);
        break;
    }
  }
};
```

### Ending Turn

```javascript
// Signal end of user speech
ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'end_turn' }));
```

